rtiums. The bee blam was huge this year and I had finally cut it back after it's major flowering when it came back up as ground cover. It didn't have time to bloom again but it's a nice plant that's not too invasive and super drought tolerant. In fact, I had to water it indirectly all summer. As long as I kept the water on the plants on either side this plant was fat and happy!","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"fabfi","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5qf1s","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Here are a few pictures of some of my late harvests.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"1iuqb","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"GALLERY","id":"92vb1","nodes":[],"galleryData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"items":[{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_9da7841e40254199b5b35ed63fb2dacd~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}}},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_4bf5f28b422842868a32842e29096749~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}}},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_9c9324782d814dee97bc35b3558feaae~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}}},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_4c72f761963f43b5a6b5d7fcc991681a~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}}}],"options":{"layout":{"type":"FULLSIZE","horizontalScroll":false,"orientation":"ROWS","numberOfColumns":3},"item":{"targetSize":300,"ratio":1,"crop":"FILL","spacing":10},"thumbnails":{"placement":"BOTTOM","spacing":0}}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"fuiis","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" Most of these tomatoes have ripened since their harvest and I've brought in several more yellow and zucchini squash. I harvested about 3 5 pound bags of new and purple potatoes from my one potato bin and I also brought in 2 more spaghetti squash that are just a touch green but the vines have withered in the frosts so I'm hopping to see them harden up in the house. If they don't they will be the first we eat and I'm sure they will be delicious!","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9sc4v","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"1jrd2","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9kslg","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"alsui","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Well, that's enough about my summer garden. I hope you found something interesting here. I know I will be dreaming through the winter about next years garden and all of the beautiful things that will grow in it.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bq4cf","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6nvjm","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Are you already making plans for next year like I am?","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"text